# the loop hands the record to `into_month`'s own arrow, though only `ok_or` and `Month()` inside take it

# the plan pairs the values a call hands with its parameters by type and count, not by place (#157): `download` is
# handed nothing for `url`, `save` its receiver last, so `to` holds nothing and comes from beyond
